  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Belize Industrial Strategy with Green and Blue Industrial Policies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As per the request of the Government of Belize, UNIDO will support the country in developing a strategic approach to provide an enabling environment for economic growth and productivity enhancement, with a specific focus on the following action areas: # A diagnostic study of the current situation of the industrial sector of Belize. # Based on the diagnostic study, develop an industrial strategy with Green and Blue industrial policies, including a Monitoring and Evaluation (M&lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt;E) framework. # Capacity development of policy makers. # Establishment of a policy infrastructure to strengthen the policy making process.</narrative>
  </description>
